# Code Quality Rules

## No `any` (E1)
`any` is forbidden. Use `unknown` and narrow. Never `// @ts-ignore`.

## oxlint + Prettier (E2)
- `npm run lint` (oxlint) and `npm run format` (Prettier) before a PR.
- Do not disable lint without a comment explaining why.

## TypeScript Must Compile Clean (E3)
`npm run build` (`nest build`) must pass. Do not cast away errors with `as unknown as X`.

## Tests (E4)
Vitest unit tests (`npm test`) and e2e (`npm run test:e2e`). Cover new pure logic and HTTP contracts. e2e must call `configureApp(app)`.
